apt install <package> -> install a package (*.deb) + its dependencies => ready to use
apt download <package> -> install a package (*.deb) => add manually to filesystem

dpkg - Debian package manager
dpkg -i <file>.deb -> install a .deb package
dpkg -l -> list
dpkg -s <pkg> -> show status
dpkg -x <file>.deb <dir> -> extract content

wget - command to download files from web
wget https://example.com/file.zip
wget -O newname.zip https://example.com/file.zip
